      "value": "The Hide and Add Action is something already in since day 1 .... \" just dont add \" if don't need.\n\nBut For Customizable Action Menu would be nice in a Creative aspect of things. Such as one Above, Change Placements. Course change to where?\n\nTo Expand upon the Current one. \n\nWith how it looks like ... why not a secondary Menu Layer that requires click from another controller.\n\nOr maybe\n\nLets call it \" ACTION WING(s) \"\n\nWhen the Action Menu is open, lets say from the Right Controller. \n\nIt would course include the Radial at the start default, then we have the Wing Support that Drops Left with a more Direct Interaction with another controller.\n\n                                <------                \n\n( Triggles / Triggers / Toggles / Float {  Action Menu  }\n\n3 Things about it.\n\nEither by Pulling the Wing out manually,\n\nIts displayed out right from the at start,\n\nOR\n\nAnimated by VRChat or By Users ( which ever is simpler )\n\nAlso the \" ACTION WING \" would have the ability to Customize in terms of size, text, placements icons and length of the wing. ( if possible that is with the current action menu )\n\nThose slots could be used for like shortcuts to said menus, toggles that would otherwise wont fit in some menus or be out of place with, or setup a master control toggles for certain things.\n\nIf all Fails.\n\nThen at least a suggestion of slight increase in Text room in each 8 slots to them areas would be nice QoL change or the ability to place the text to the Side of them instead of directly Under them where the Icon over shadows them or blends horribly.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-04T01:06:36.844Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add the ability to customize the action menu however you want.\n - Change Placements\n - Hide/Add Action Menu Buttons\nThis would allow further customization to the game to your liking.",
